[{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"665190f9-de37-45ef-a731-0ee5b33fbe38","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[3,9],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"LaccicoKategoriebaum","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"f4fcaf6e-6791-42ee-85cc-3798d8c95f17","isGlobalTemplate":false},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0,"content":{"anzeigen":true}},{"name":"DetailsList","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"f135f112-5485-41c6-9cb7-276273079ac8","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"visible":true,"layout":{"fullWidth":false,"caretPosition":"right"}},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"23fa22b5-94c2-4fd7-8dfb-539939f875c6","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>With grey clothing, a grey lace is the discreet choice. It picks up the tone of the fabric without pushing itself forward.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Whether suit, trouser suit or skirt suit: the darker the fabric, the darker the lace may be. Dark grey flannel suits slate grey or Grigio Scuro, a light linen suit light grey or Grigio Perla.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Fabric &amp; shade of grey&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Fabric</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shade of grey on the lace</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect on a black shoe</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Anthracite, dark grey<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Flannel, worsted</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Slate grey, Grigio Scuro</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Almost tone-on-tone with the shoe, picks up the fabric.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Mid grey<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Worsted</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Mid grey, Grigio Medio</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible, but calm.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Light grey<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Linen</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Light grey, Grigio Perla</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Clear contrast, summery.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Any shade of grey<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Fine cloth</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Grey, flat</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Very understated, a small surprise for connoisseurs.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Which shoelace colour goes discreetly with anthracite and grey suits?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"7a330335-7aa8-464e-b882-e5939c55eb2b","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Yes. Poorly finished eyelets often have sharp burrs. Over time, every lace chafes through on them, even a good one.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The burrs arise when punching with old tools and are transferred to the thin eyelet metal. The wax protects the lace against abrasion, but no lace can hold out against a sharp edge for ever. Master's tip: if the lace always chafes at the same eyelet, deburr that eyelet once.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Wear on eyelets &amp; hooks&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Cause</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect on the lace</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Remedy</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Suitable series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Burr on the eyelet<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Punched edge</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Chafes through at one spot.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Deburr the eyelet once.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Applies to all laces</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Eyelet too narrow<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Eyelet size</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The surface is put under heavy strain when pulled through.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The lace should pass easily through the eyelet. For concealed eyelets, use the 2 mm round lace.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Hooks<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Direction of pull</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Chafes when pulled into the hook under tension.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Cross first, then lay it in under tension.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS (3 mm)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Can fine shoelaces be permanently damaged by poor-quality or sharp metal eyelets?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"2443642e-ede0-4e9e-b0d6-d2b33e6d798a","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The length can hardly be calculated. The safest way is to measure the old laces unlaced. The number of pairs of eyelets serves as a guide.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The right length depends on the lacing style, the foot and the thickness of the lace. Thicker laces need a little more length. For women's sizes, one size shorter is often enough.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Length tip&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Pairs of eyelets</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Length</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Typical shoes</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Grey series in this length</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">1–2 pairs<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Very short lacing</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">45 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Low shoes with one pair of holes</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">3–4 pairs<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Short lacing</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">60 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Derbies with low-set lacing, casual shoes</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">4–5 pairs<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Classic</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">75 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Derbies and Oxfords with five pairs of holes</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">5–6 pairs<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Classic, wider foot</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">90 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Classics for a wider foot, sneakers</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">7–8 pairs<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Laced high</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">120 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Sneakers, lace-up ankle boots</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">from 9 pairs<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Boots</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">150–180 cm</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Boots and women's boots</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2 (up to 180 cm)</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3 (150 cm)</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6 (150 cm)</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>More on our <a href=\"/en/laccico-finest-waxed-laces/shoelace-length\" style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline\">Shoelace length</a> page.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"How do you work out the right shoelace length for shoes?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"9035be48-6e06-45c0-b0ad-82c49b1cdcff","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The ends are sealed with crimped aglets. As long as the tip stays in place, the lace cannot fray there.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The dense braid of 100 % cotton and the waxing also protect the lace against abrasion. If a tip does come loose after long use, the lace may fray at that point. Then it is time for a new pair.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Tip &amp; braid&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Construction</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Tip<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Aglet</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Crimped</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The ends do not fray.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Braid<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">100 % cotton</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Densely braided</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Tear-resistant, does not stretch out.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Waxing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Finish</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Waxed, hot-rolled and polished</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Long-lasting, protects against moisture.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6xr\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-XR</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Why don't waxed shoelaces fray at the ends?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"ff207a47-f090-499f-85c4-dff27995d46f","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Grey laces go tone-on-tone with grey suede, nubuck and canvas. On black smooth leather they set a calm contrast.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">On sneakers, a light shade of grey looks softer than pure white. Greige, a grey with a hint of beige, also suits light suede. Anthracite is available as the strong flat lace F6-XR for boots.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Colour &amp; leather matching&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shoe</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shade of grey</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Black smooth leather<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Oxford, Derby</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Slate grey, Grigio Scuro, Grigio Ferro</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Calm contrast, looks almost black.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Smooth leather in black or grey<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Plain Derby</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Grey</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Lies flat and discreet.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Grey suede<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Nubuck, suede</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Pebble grey, mid grey</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Tone-on-tone.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Navy leather<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Smooth leather or suede</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Light grey, mid grey</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Lighter, cool accent.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Sneakers<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">White or grey</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Light grey, ash grey, greige</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Softer than pure white.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Boots<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Workwear, heritage</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Anthracite</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6xr\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-XR</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Strong, in a vintage look.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Which leather and shoe colours can grey and anthracite shoelaces be combined with?","defaultOpen":false}}}],"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"CategoryData","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"70599911-9cf9-4292-a59d-bea7e0e698c6","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"name":"","fields":{"name":true,"description1":true,"description2":false,"shortDescription":false},"fieldsOrder":["name","description1","description2","shortDescription"],"fieldsDisabled":[],"displayCategoryImage":"off","image":{"fillMode":"fill","alt":"","brightness":0.75},"text":{"color":"#121212","bgColor":"#fbfbf9","bgOpacity":1,"textAlignment":"left","justify":"top","align":"left","background":f